<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 13.6 pct yr/yr in Dec.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 13.6 pct yr/yr in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 13.6 percent year on year in December against a revised 13.4 percent in November, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.76 trillion baht in December from revised 3.65 trillion in November.</p>
<p>    M-2			 Dec 96     Nov 96	   Dec 95</p>
<p>    Money supply	     3.76	3.65		3.31</p>
<p>    Percentage change	13.6	13.4		17.0</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said December figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
